# 96_ttl_cross_host with the Fast fact emitted by a rule rather than asserted
# by the host ([LDET.5.11], [LDTL.6.1]). Src 2 enters at 1.5 s and `spawn`
# emits Fast 2 in that pump, deadline 2.5 s; Slow 1, a host assert at 0, has
# 3 s. The sweep at 3 s expires Fast 2, then Slow 1. A rule-emitted fact
# reaches the sweep by another path from a host's. Pinned by the recordings
# cross-read.
# @spec [LDET.5.11]
assert Slow id=1
pump
advance 1500000000
assert Src id=2
pump
advance 1500000000
pump
